      "display_order": 1,
      "question_text": "The intersection equation is $cx^2-4x+(c-3)=0$. A tangent gives one repeated root, so its discriminant is zero. Substitute $a=c$, $b=-4$ and $d=c-3$ into $b^2-4ad=0$, then simplify.",
